#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:1
msgid "Manage a resident"
msgstr "Gérer un habitant"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:4
msgid ""
"Create a resident, record their admission and stay, and enter the Katz "
"assessment."
msgstr ""
"Créer un habitant, enregistrer son admission et son séjour, saisir "
"l'évaluation Katz."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:8
msgid "How do I create a resident in Resthome?"
msgstr "Comment créer un habitant dans Resthome ?"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:9
msgid ""
"Open the MR/MRS -> Residents app and click New. Enter at least the name, "
"date of birth, gender, the NISS if known, and the health insurance fund, "
"then save."
msgstr ""
"Ouvrez l'application MR/MRS → Habitants et cliquez sur Nouveau. Saisissez"
" au minimum le nom, la date de naissance, le genre, le NISS s'il est "
"connu, et la mutuelle, puis enregistrez."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:11
msgid "Is the NISS mandatory to create a resident?"
msgstr "Le NISS est-il obligatoire pour créer un habitant ?"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:12
msgid ""
"No. You can create a resident without a NISS, but insurability checks "
"(MDA) and agreements (eAgreement) cannot be sent without it, so fill it "
"in as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Non. Vous pouvez créer un habitant sans NISS, mais la vérification "
"d'assurabilité (MDA) et les accords (eAgreement) ne peuvent pas être "
"envoyés sans lui : complétez-le dès que possible."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:14
msgid "What is the difference between confirming and starting a stay?"
msgstr "Quelle est la différence entre confirmer et démarrer un séjour ?"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:15
msgid ""
"Confirming reserves the room and makes the admission date fields appear. "
"Starting the stay records that the resident is actually present, and it "
"is that step which triggers billing."
msgstr ""
"Confirmer réserve la chambre et fait apparaître les champs de date "
"d'admission. Démarrer le séjour acte que l'habitant est effectivement "
"présent, et c'est cette étape qui déclenche la facturation."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:17
msgid "What does Resthome do automatically when a stay starts?"
msgstr "Que fait Resthome automatiquement au démarrage d'un séjour ?"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:18
msgid ""
"It adds the resident to the open billing periods, creates the first "
"accommodation invoice for residents billed in advance, opens the month's "
"supplements envelope, and creates the admission eAgreement when the NISS "
"is present."
msgstr ""
"Il ajoute l'habitant aux périodes de facturation ouvertes, crée la "
"première facture d'hébergement pour les habitants facturés par "
"anticipation, ouvre l'enveloppe de suppléments du mois et crée "
"l'eAgreement d'admission lorsque le NISS est présent."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:20
msgid "What happens if the resident has no validated Katz assessment?"
msgstr "Que se passe-t-il si l'habitant n'a pas d'évaluation Katz validée ?"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:21
msgid ""
"The resident stays in category O by default and a \"Katz to do\" reminder"
" appears on the dashboard, since the Katz category determines the INAMI "
"flat-rate fee."
msgstr ""
"L'habitant reste en catégorie O par défaut et un rappel « Katz à faire » "
"apparaît sur le tableau de bord, puisque la catégorie Katz détermine le "
"forfait INAMI."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:24
msgid ""
"This page describes a resident's complete journey in Resthome: from "
"**creation** to **active stay**, including the **Katz assessment** that "
"governs INAMI billing."
msgstr ""
"Cette page décrit le parcours complet d'un habitant dans Resthome : de sa"
" **création** à son **séjour actif**, en passant par l'**évaluation "
"Katz** qui conditionne la facturation INAMI."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:26
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:36
msgid "Two dates not to confuse"
msgstr "Deux dates à ne pas confondre"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:39
msgid "**Stay start date**: when accommodation billing begins (the room)."
msgstr ""
"**Date de début de séjour** : quand commence la facturation de "
"l'hébergement (la chambre)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:40
msgid ""
"**Admission date**: when the INAMI intervention begins (the flat-rate "
"fee)."
msgstr "**Date d'admission** : quand commence l'intervention INAMI (le forfait)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:42
msgid "They are often identical, but can differ — Resthome handles both."
msgstr ""
"Elles sont souvent identiques, mais peuvent différer — Resthome gère les "
"deux."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:45
msgid "1. Create the resident"
msgstr "1\\. Créer l'habitant"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:47
msgid "Open the **MR/MRS → Residents** application."
msgstr "Ouvrez l'application **MR/MRS → Habitants**."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:48
msgid "Click **New**."
msgstr "Cliquez sur **Nouveau**."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:49
msgid ""
"Enter at least: **name**, **date of birth**, **gender**, and the **NISS**"
" (national number) if known."
msgstr ""
"Renseignez au minimum : **nom**, **date de naissance**, **genre**, et le "
"**NISS** (numéro national) s'il est connu."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:50
msgid "Select the resident's **health insurance fund**."
msgstr "Sélectionnez la **mutuelle** de l'habitant."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:51
#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:81
msgid "**Save**."
msgstr "**Enregistrez**."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:53
msgid ""
"![Resident record: the Katz category and stay type badges, the personal "
"information tab, the current stay and the health insurance fund "
"details](../assets/screenshots/residents/05-fiche-resident.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Fiche habitant : les pastilles de catégorie Katz et de type de séjour, "
"l'onglet des informations personnelles, le séjour en cours et les données"
" de mutuelle](../assets/screenshots/residents/05-fiche-resident.png)"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:53
msgid ""
"Resident record: the Katz category and stay type badges, the personal "
"information tab, the current stay and the health insurance fund details"
msgstr ""
"Fiche habitant : les pastilles de catégorie Katz et de type de séjour, "
"l'onglet des informations personnelles, le séjour en cours et les données"
" de mutuelle"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:55
msgid "Reading the identity card (eID)"
msgstr "Lire la carte d'identité (eID)"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:57
msgid ""
"Rather than typing the identity in, you can **read the resident's eID "
"card**. Resthome fills in the name, the date of birth, the gender and the"
" **NISS** from the card itself — no typo, no transposed digit."
msgstr ""
"Plutôt que de saisir l'identité, vous pouvez **lire la carte eID de "
"l'habitant**. Resthome renseigne le nom, la date de naissance, le genre "
"et le **NISS** depuis la carte elle-même — sans faute de frappe ni "
"chiffre inversé."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:61
msgid "From an **existing record**, the eID reading **updates** that resident."
msgstr ""
"Depuis une **fiche existante**, la lecture eID **met à jour** cet "
"habitant."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:62
msgid ""
"From the **New resident via eID** menu entry, Resthome looks the person "
"up by NISS and **creates** the record if it does not exist yet."
msgstr ""
"Depuis l'entrée de menu **Nouveau habitant via eID**, Resthome recherche "
"la personne par son NISS et **crée** la fiche si elle n'existe pas "
"encore."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:65
msgid "A card reader must be connected to the workstation."
msgstr "Un lecteur de carte doit être connecté au poste de travail."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:67
msgid "The NISS is required for eHealth"
msgstr "Le NISS est nécessaire pour l'eHealth"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:70
msgid ""
"Without a NISS, insurability verification (MDA) and agreements "
"(eAgreement) cannot be sent. You can create the resident without a NISS, "
"but remember to fill it in as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Sans NISS, la vérification d'assurabilité (MDA) et les accords "
"(eAgreement) ne peuvent pas être envoyés. Vous pouvez créer l'habitant "
"sans NISS, mais pensez à le compléter dès que possible."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:73
msgid "2. Open a stay agreement"
msgstr "2\\. Ouvrir une convention de séjour"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:75
msgid "The **stay** links the resident to a room and triggers billing."
msgstr "Le **séjour** relie l'habitant à une chambre et déclenche la facturation."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:77
msgid "On the resident record, open the **Convention** tab."
msgstr "Sur la fiche de l'habitant, ouvrez l'onglet **Convention**."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:78
msgid "Click **Add a line**."
msgstr "Cliquez sur **Ajouter une ligne**."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:79
msgid "Choose the **room** (only available rooms are offered)."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez la **chambre** (seules les chambres disponibles sont "
"proposées)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:80
msgid "Enter the **stay type** (MR or MRS) and the **stay start date**."
msgstr ""
"Indiquez le **type de séjour** (MR ou MRS) et la **date de début de "
"séjour**."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:83
msgid "The stay is then in the **Draft** state."
msgstr "Le séjour est alors en état **Brouillon**."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:85
msgid "3. Confirm then start the stay"
msgstr "3\\. Confirmer puis démarrer le séjour"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:87
msgid "The stay goes through two steps:"
msgstr "Le séjour passe par deux étapes :"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:89
msgid ""
"**Confirm** — the stay becomes *Confirmed* (the room is reserved). The "
"**admission date and time** fields appear: fill them in."
msgstr ""
"**Confirmer** — le séjour devient *Confirmé* (la chambre est réservée). "
"Les champs **date et heure d'admission** apparaissent : complétez-les."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:90
msgid ""
"**Start Stay** — the stay becomes *In Progress* (the resident is actually"
" present)."
msgstr ""
"**Start Stay (Démarrer)** — le séjour devient *En cours* (l'habitant est "
"effectivement présent)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:92
msgid "What starting the stay triggers automatically"
msgstr "Ce que le démarrage déclenche automatiquement"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:95
msgid "When the stay starts, Resthome:"
msgstr "Au démarrage, Resthome :"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:97
msgid "adds the resident to the open **billing periods**;"
msgstr "ajoute l'habitant aux **périodes de facturation** ouvertes ;"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:98
msgid ""
"for a resident billed in advance, creates the **first accommodation "
"invoice** for the admission month;"
msgstr ""
"crée, pour un habitant facturé en avance, la **première facture "
"d'hébergement** du mois d'admission ;"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:99
msgid "opens the month's **supplements envelope**;"
msgstr "ouvre l'**enveloppe de suppléments** du mois ;"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:100
msgid "creates the **admission eAgreement** (if the NISS is present)."
msgstr "crée l'**eAgreement d'admission** (si le NISS est présent)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:103
msgid "4. Enter the Katz assessment"
msgstr "4\\. Saisir l'évaluation Katz"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:105
msgid ""
"The **Katz** category (O, A, B, C, Cd) determines the **INAMI flat-rate "
"fee**."
msgstr "La catégorie **Katz** (O, A, B, C, Cd) détermine le **forfait INAMI**."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:107
msgid ""
"From the resident record, open **Assessment tools → Katz** (or the "
"**Katz** button)."
msgstr ""
"Depuis la fiche de l'habitant, ouvrez **Outils d'évaluation → Katz** (ou "
"le bouton **Katz**)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:108
msgid ""
"Click **New** and score the 6 criteria (washing, dressing, transfer, "
"going to the toilet, continence, eating)."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur **Nouveau** et cotez les 6 critères (toilette, habillage, "
"transfert, aller à la toilette, continence, manger)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:109
msgid "**Confirm** then **Validate** the assessment."
msgstr "**Confirmez** puis **Validez** l'évaluation."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:111
msgid "No validated Katz?"
msgstr "Pas de Katz validé ?"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:114
msgid ""
"As long as no validated Katz exists, the resident is in category **O** by"
" default, and a \"Katz to do\" reminder appears on the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Tant qu'aucun Katz validé n'existe, l'habitant est en catégorie **O** par"
" défaut, et un rappel « Katz à faire » apparaît sur le tableau de bord."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:117
msgid "5. Check insurability (MDA)"
msgstr "5\\. Vérifier l'assurabilité (MDA)"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:119
msgid "Before billing, check that the resident is properly insured:"
msgstr "Avant de facturer, vérifiez que l'habitant est bien assuré :"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:121
msgid "Open the month's billing period, or the resident record."
msgstr "Ouvrez la période de facturation du mois, ou la fiche de l'habitant."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:122
msgid "Run an **MDA check** (MyCareNet/WalCareNet insurability)."
msgstr "Lancez une **vérification MDA** (assurabilité MyCareNet/WalCareNet)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:123
msgid ""
"Resthome automatically updates the **health insurance fund** and the "
"**BIM** status where applicable."
msgstr ""
"Resthome met à jour automatiquement la **mutuelle** et le statut **BIM** "
"le cas échéant."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:125
msgid "Special cases"
msgstr "Cas particuliers"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:127
msgid ""
"**Room change**: use the dedicated action on the stay — accommodation "
"billing is split across the two rates, without a new admission."
msgstr ""
"**Changement de chambre** : utilisez l'action dédiée sur le séjour — la "
"facturation de l'hébergement est scindée aux deux tarifs, sans nouvelle "
"admission."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:128
msgid ""
"**MR ↔ MRS transfer**: a wizard records the transfer date and updates the"
" stay type."
msgstr ""
"**Transfert MR ↔ MRS** : un assistant enregistre la date de transfert et "
"met à jour le type de séjour."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:129
msgid ""
"**Absence / hospitalization**: see the [Billing](../facturation/index.md)"
" section — an absence adjusts the flat-rate fee and can generate an "
"eHealth notification (Annexe 11)."
msgstr ""
"**Absence / hospitalisation** : voir la section "
"[Facturation](../facturation/index.md) — l'absence ajuste le forfait et "
"peut générer une notification eHealth (Annexe 11)."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:130
msgid ""
"**End of stay / death**: close the stay; Resthome stops billing on the "
"correct date and prepares the credit note if needed."
msgstr ""
"**Fin de séjour / décès** : clôturez le séjour ; Resthome arrête la "
"facturation à la bonne date et prépare, si nécessaire, la note de crédit."

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:132
msgid "Further reading"
msgstr "Pour aller plus loin"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:134
msgid "[Billing](../facturation/index.md)"
msgstr "[Facturation](../facturation/index.md)"

#: ../../content/residents/gerer-un-resident.md:135
msgid "[eHealth](../ehealth/index.md)"
msgstr "[eHealth](../ehealth/index.md)"

